{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>במדה</b> — three times. דין (judgment) and the other: אך רחוק יהיה ביניכם ובינו כאלפים אמה במדה (only a distance shall be between you and him, about two thousand cubits by measure). Just as there it speaks of land measurement, so too here it speaks of land measurement: מה התם איירי במדת קרקע אף הכא איירי במדת קרקע."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "The comment identifies במדה appearing three times in the Masorah; the second occurrence is cited from Joshua 3:4. The phrase דין ואידך introduces the third occurrence implicitly, but its specific citation is not given here."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:07.600019450Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}